WEBVTT

00:00:00.174 --> 00:00:02.784
What if UPI stopped
working for one whole day?

00:00:02.819 --> 00:00:05.379
Every month,
UPI handles billions of payments,

00:00:05.379 --> 00:00:08.409
from big shops to a chai
stall on the roadside.

00:00:08.690 --> 00:00:13.080
If it went down, millions of people would
reach the counter and find they can't pay.

00:00:13.150 --> 00:00:15.180
Most of us don't carry much cash anymore.

00:00:15.426 --> 00:00:17.086
ATMs would get long queues.

00:00:17.086 --> 00:00:19.716
Small shop owners would
lose a full day of sales.

00:00:19.837 --> 00:00:22.107
Bills, rent and online orders would stall.

00:00:22.207 --> 00:00:23.377
It wouldn't just be inconvenient.

00:00:23.932 --> 00:00:25.222
For many small businesses,

00:00:25.692 --> 00:00:28.302
one day without payments
is a day without income.

00:00:28.363 --> 00:00:29.793
When did you last carry cash?

00:00:29.963 --> 00:00:32.933
So what if UPI stopped
working for one whole day?

